; before.nol — ЧТО НАМЕРЯЛИ ДО ПЕРЕРЫВА.
; Свидетельств не хватает: гейт сворачивает действие и печатает недостачу.

witness first_reading : (randomised, abstract)
  says "first pass over the abstracts: effect present, magnitude unclear"
  source conference_abstracts
  evidence 3 for 1 against

ask contrary_reports
  in registry, preprints
  found nothing because "searched the registry and the preprint servers, nothing contrary"

claim effect_holds
  from first_reading
  searched contrary_reports

perform publish_guidance on effect_holds
